ds such as Lavazza, Huang Ji Huang, Little Sheep and Taco Bell. We have the exclusive right to operate and sublicense the KFC, Pizza Hut and, subject to the agreed terms, Taco Bell brands in China (excluding Hong Kong, Macau and Taiwan), and own the intellectual property of the Little Sheep and Huang Ji Huang concepts outright. We also established a joint venture with Lavazza Group, the world-renowned family-owned Italian coffee company, to explore and develop the Lavazza coffee concept in China. KFC was the first major global restaurant brand to enter China in 1987. With more than three decades of operations, we have developed extensive operating experience in the China market. We believe that there are significant opportunities to further expand within China, and we intend to focus our efforts on increasing our geographic footprint in both existing and new cities.","context":"Introduction","section":"Item 2. Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations","block":280,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-341077","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-10","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001673358","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1673358/000119312526341077/yumc-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cd7d6183e650bdf4fbd7e46b8ed42ee55ec766e8d6cbef49582965241c398298.bin","sha256":"cd7d6183e650bdf4fbd7e46b8ed42ee55ec766e8d6cbef49582965241c398298"}},{"id":"1261320fc840d51b17752ebc514197c4066466994cb7f3482d67bd35a61a47ca","quote":"KFC is the leading and the largest quick-service restaurant (“QSR”) brand in China in terms of 2025 system sales. As of June 30, 2026, KFC operated 13,789 restaurants in over 2,700 cities across China.","context":"Yum China Holdings, Inc. is the largest restaurant company in China in terms of 2025 system sales, with 19,297 restaurants covering over 2,700 cities primarily in China as of June 30, 20