nt where such expenses are included. ASU 2024-03 is effective for the Company for annual period from January 1, 2027, and for interim periods from January 1, 2028, with early adoption permitted. We are currently evaluating the impact the adoption of this standard may have on our financial statements.","section":"Performance Metrics","block":456,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-341077","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-10","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001673358","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1673358/000119312526341077/yumc-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cd7d6183e650bdf4fbd7e46b8ed42ee55ec766e8d6cbef49582965241c398298.bin","sha256":"cd7d6183e650bdf4fbd7e46b8ed42ee55ec766e8d6cbef49582965241c398298"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0}},"warnings":["operatingKpis: evidence cap reached."]},{"version":1,"source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-341077","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-10","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001673358","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1673358/000119312526341077/yumc-ex10_1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/a365301fecbbc9037ea4eaac412a4204cd4581ffaa732c3500f1569c5a25a612.bin","sha256":"a365301fecbbc9037ea4eaac412a4204cd4581ffaa732c3500f1569c5a25a612"},"layers":{"businessProfile":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"operatingKpis":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"9e44385acaf282f9c20d5218856cc1091a047cc620537f6d6c25253a17a88cd5","quote":"Section 1.2 Other Definitional Provisions and Interpretation; Schedules. The headings preceding the text of Articles and Sections included in this Agreement and the headings to Exhibits and Schedules attached to this Agreement are for convenience only and shall not be deemed part of this Agreement or be given any effect in interpreting this Agreement. The use of the masculine, feminine, or neuter gender or the singular or plural form of words 